  "result": "Excellent! All tests pass. The statement functionality is now fully implemented with 14 comprehensive tests:\n\n**Created `src/statements.js`:**\n- **`statement(customerId, invoices, asOf)`** generates customer statements\n  - Validates customer exists (returns CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND if not)\n  - Filters invoices to show only those with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid'\n  - Filters to only invoices with issueDate on or before asOf\n  - Returns each invoice as `{ number, issueDate, dueDate, total, due }`\n  - Sorts by issueDate ascending\n  - Calculates totalDue as sum of all due amounts\n  - Returns `ok({ customerId, invoices, totalDue })`\n\n**Test coverage (14 new tests):**\n- Basic listing of customer invoices\n- Filtering draft invoices\n- Filtering by asOf date\n- All required fields present\n- Due calculation (balanceDue)\n- totalDue aggregation\n- Payment deduction from due\n- Sort order by issueDate\n- Customer-specific filtering\n- Empty results when no matching invoices\n- Unknown customer error handling\n- Including partially_paid invoices\n- Customer ID normalization\n- Filtering out paid invoices\n\nAll 197 tests pass (183 existing + 14 new).",
